# Smoke: an accepted Request to the first accepted Discovery.
id: discovery-smoke
skill: highway-discovery
fixture: request
smoke: yes
web: yes
open: /highway-discovery Automate Weekly Order Restock Alerts
ask: Would you like to analyze the Request, or explore the Discovery?
say: [select] Analyze the Request.
ask: What would you add, correct, or remove?
say: [accept] Looks good.
ask-pattern: \?
say: [accept] Yes, go ahead.
writes: discoveries/discoveries.md
writes: discoveries/*.md
expect: template discoveries/discoveries.md :: discovery-catalog.md
expect: template discoveries/DISC*.md :: discovery-record.md
